# REDUCED COST
Shows the value of cost that must be removed from the objective cost before it can be considered in the optimal equation.
Possibly variables, environmental factors or external factors could reduce the objective cost beyond these reduced costs, then we could consider them in our equation.
In other words considering variable 12 (x12), cost of each unit in Offa must be reduced by 80.02 naira from 148.75 Naira to 68.73 Naira, for us to consider it in our optimal equation.
